  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bunyangabu Honey Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Beekeeping - Honey, Beneficiaries: 436 small holder beekeepers of whom 97 are women., Project funds will be used for expansion of store and processing rooms; acquisition of modern storage and processing equipment; consolidation of marketing activities. Some of the grant funds will be used to improve the working capital position of the cooperative. ,</narrative>
